#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:4
msgid "Share / Access"
msgstr "分享 / 存取"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:6
msgid ""
"|share-alt| **Share** and |unlock-alt| **Access** are the two menus to "
"manage how other users can interact with your documents on CryptPad."
msgstr ""
"|share-alt| **分享** 與 |unlock-alt| **存取** 是 CryptPad "
"上用來管理其他使用者如何與您文件互動的兩個選單。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:8
msgid ""
"From the document toolbar: |share-alt| **Share** and |unlock-alt| "
"**Access** at the center."
msgstr "從文件工具列：中央的 |share-alt| **分享** 與 |unlock-alt| **存取**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:9
msgid ""
"From the CryptDrive: ``Right click`` on a document > |share-alt| "
"**Share** or |unlock-alt| **Access**."
msgstr "從 CryptDrive：在文件上 ``按右鍵`` > |share-alt| **分享** 或 |unlock-alt| **存取**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:14
msgid "Share"
msgstr "分享"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:16
msgid ""
"There are three ways to share a document: :ref:`share_contacts`, "
":ref:`share_link`, and :ref:`share_embed`. In each case, access rights "
"can be set to authorise the recipient to edit the document, or to only "
"view it."
msgstr ""
"分享文件有三種方式：:ref:`share_contacts`、:ref:`share_link` 與 "
":ref:`share_embed`。每種方式都可設定存取權限，讓收件者能編輯文件或僅能檢視。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:21
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr "存取權限"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:23
msgid "There are 4 levels of permissions:"
msgstr "共有 4 種權限等級："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:25
msgid "**View**: Read-only without editing the document."
msgstr "**檢視**：僅能閱讀，無法編輯文件。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Present**: Read-only the rendered output of the document, available in "
"the :ref:`app_code` and :ref:`app_slides` applications."
msgstr "**簡報**：僅能檢視文件的轉譯輸出，適用於 :ref:`app_code` 與 :ref:`app_slides` 應用程式。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:27
msgid "**Edit**: View and make changes to the document."
msgstr "**編輯**：可檢視並修改文件。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:28
msgid ""
"**View once and self-destruct**: Read-only **one time**. Once the link is"
" opened by a recipient, the document is deleted permanently. "
":badge_user:`Logged in users`"
msgstr "**單次檢視後自毀**：僅能**檢視一次**。連結被收件人開啟後，文件將永久刪除。 :badge_user:`已登入使用者`"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:32
msgid ""
"If a document is already stored in the CryptDrive of a user with edit "
"rights, the “edit link” is shown in the document’s properties even if the"
" user is in View mode."
msgstr "若文件已儲存於具編輯權限使用者的 CryptDrive 中，即使該使用者處於檢視模式，文件的屬性中仍會顯示「編輯連結」。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:37
msgid "Sharing with contacts"
msgstr "與聯絡人分享"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:39
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:114
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:160
msgid ":badge_user:`Logged in users`"
msgstr ":badge_user:`已登入使用者`"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:41
msgid ""
"This is the recommended method for sharing documents securely on "
"CryptPad. When sharing directly with :ref:`contacts <contacts>`, document"
" links never leave the encrypted platform of CryptPad. This prevents data"
" from being leaked to third parties."
msgstr ""
"這是 CryptPad 上安全分享文件的推薦方式。直接與 :ref:`聯絡人 <contacts>` 分享時，文件連結不會離開 CryptPad "
"的加密平台，可避免資料外洩給第三方。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:47
msgid "To share with one or more contacts:"
msgstr "若要與一位或多位聯絡人分享："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:49
msgid ""
"|share-alt| **Share** in the document toolbar > |address-book| "
"**Contacts**."
msgstr "在文件工具列點選 |share-alt| **分享** > |address-book| **聯絡人**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:50
msgid ""
"``Right click`` on the document in the CryptDrive > |share-alt| **Share**"
" > |address-book| **Contacts**."
msgstr "在 CryptDrive 中的文件上 ``按右鍵`` > |share-alt| **分享** > |address-book| **聯絡人**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:52
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:78
msgid "Then:"
msgstr "接著："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:54
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:105
msgid "Choose the :ref:`access rights <share_access_rights>`."
msgstr "選擇 :ref:`存取權限 <share_access_rights>`。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:55
msgid "Select the contacts or teams to share with."
msgstr "選擇要分享的聯絡人或團隊。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:56
msgid "**Share** button."
msgstr "按下 **分享** 按鈕。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:60
msgid ""
"When sharing with contacts, they receive a notification. When sharing "
"with a team, the document is added directly to the team’s CryptDrive."
msgstr "與聯絡人分享時，對方會收到通知。與團隊分享時，文件會直接加入該團隊的 CryptDrive。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:66
msgid "Sharing a link"
msgstr "分享連結"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:68
msgid ""
"The **Link** tab provides links that can be shared through the medium of "
"your choice. Depending on how you send the link, this method can present "
"security risks. To add a level of security, it is recommended to add a "
":ref:`password <access_tab>` to your document before sharing the link."
msgstr ""
"**連結** 分頁提供可透過您選擇的管道分享的連結。依傳送方式不同，此方式可能有安全風險。為提高安全性，建議在分享連結前先為文件設定 "
":ref:`密碼 <access_tab>`。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:73
msgid "To copy the link to a document:"
msgstr "若要複製文件連結："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:75
msgid "From the document: |share-alt| **Share** in the toolbar > |link| **Link**."
msgstr "在文件中：工具列點選 |share-alt| **分享** > |link| **連結**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:76
msgid ""
"From the CryptDrive : ``Right click`` on the document > |share-alt| "
"**Share** > |link| **Link**."
msgstr "在 CryptDrive：在文件上 ``按右鍵`` > |share-alt| **分享** > |link| **連結**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:80
msgid ""
"Choose the :ref:`access rights <share_access_rights>` and additional "
"options:"
msgstr "選擇 :ref:`存取權限 <share_access_rights>` 與其他選項："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:82
msgid "**Embed mode** hides the toolbar and user list."
msgstr "**內嵌模式**會隱藏工具列與使用者名單。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Preview** allows to check what the link will look like before sending "
"it."
msgstr "**預覽**可讓您在傳送前檢查連結的顯示效果。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:85
msgid "**Copy** the link."
msgstr "**複製**連結。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:86
msgid "Send the link."
msgstr "傳送連結。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:91
msgid "Embedding"
msgstr "內嵌"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:93
msgid "Embedding allows for a CryptPad document to be displayed on a web page."
msgstr "內嵌可讓 CryptPad 文件顯示於網頁上。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:98
msgid "To embed a document:"
msgstr "若要內嵌文件："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:100
msgid ""
"From the document : |share-alt| **Share** in the toolbar > |code| "
"**Embed**."
msgstr "在文件中：工具列點選 |share-alt| **分享** > |code| **內嵌**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:101
msgid ""
"From the CryptDrive : ``Right click`` on the document > |share-alt| "
"**Share** > |code| **Embed**."
msgstr "在 CryptDrive 中：以滑鼠右鍵點擊文件 > |share-alt| **分享** > |code| **嵌入**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:103
msgid "then"
msgstr "接著"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:106
msgid "**Copy** the embed code."
msgstr "**複製**內嵌程式碼。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:107
msgid "Paste the code on a web page."
msgstr "將程式碼貼到網頁上。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:112
msgid "Shared folders"
msgstr "共用資料夾"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:116
msgid "Shared folders are made for sharing a set of documents at once."
msgstr "共用資料夾用於一次分享多份文件。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:120
msgid ""
"Shared folders are impacting the storage quota of everyone who has them "
"in their drive. Hence, it's usage should be limited and ideally used only"
" in last resort, when a :ref:`team <teams>` isn't fitting for the use "
"case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:122
msgid "To create a shared folder in the CryptDrive:"
msgstr "若要在 CryptDrive 中建立共用資料夾："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:124
msgid "``+ New`` > |cptools shared-folder| **Shared folder**."
msgstr "``+ 新增`` > |cptools shared-folder| **共用資料夾**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:125
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl + e` > |cptools shared-folder| **Shared folder**."
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl + e` > |cptools shared-folder| **共用資料夾**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:126
msgid "``Right click`` > |cptools shared-folder| **New shared folder**."
msgstr "``按右鍵`` > |cptools shared-folder| **新增共用資料夾**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:128
msgid "To convert an existing folder into a shared folder:"
msgstr "若要將現有資料夾轉為共用資料夾："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:130
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:138
msgid "``Right click`` on the folder > |share-alt| **Share**."
msgstr "在資料夾上 ``按右鍵`` > |share-alt| **分享**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:131
msgid "Choose the conversion options. Password. :ref:`Owned <owners>` folder."
msgstr "選擇轉換選項。密碼。:ref:`擁有者 <owners>` 資料夾。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:134
msgid "``OK`` or press the :kbd:`Enter` key."
msgstr "按 ``確定`` 或按下 :kbd:`Enter` 鍵。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:136
msgid ""
"Folders are shared in a similar way to documents. To share a folder from "
"the CryptDrive:"
msgstr "資料夾的分享方式與文件類似。若要從 CryptDrive 分享資料夾："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:139
msgid ""
"Choose the `access rights <#access-rights>`__. **View**: Read-only "
"without editing the contents of the folder. **Edit**: View and make "
"changes to the folder."
msgstr "選擇 `存取權限 <#access-rights>`__。**檢視**：僅能閱讀，無法編輯資料夾內容。**編輯**：可檢視並修改資料夾。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:142
msgid ""
"Three tabs are available: |address-book| **Contacts**: Recommended method"
" to share securely with contacts and teams on CryptPad. |link| **Link**: "
"Copy a link to send through the medium of your choice. |code| **Embed**: "
"Copy code to include the folder on a web page."
msgstr ""
"提供三個分頁：|address-book| **聯絡人**：在 CryptPad 上與聯絡人及團隊安全分享的推薦方式。|link| "
"**連結**：複製連結後透過您選擇的管道傳送。|code| **內嵌**：複製程式碼以將資料夾嵌入網頁。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:151
msgid ""
"Shared folders have their own history, separate from the "
":ref:`drive_history`. Restoring the history of the drive does not affect "
"shared folders, conversely the history of a shared folder can be restored"
" without affecting the rest of the drive."
msgstr ""
"共用資料夾有獨立的歷史記錄，與 :ref:`drive_history` "
"分開。還原磁碟的歷史不會影響共用資料夾；反之，還原共用資料夾的歷史也不會影響磁碟其餘部分。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:153
msgid "Please note that, once shared, they cannot be reverted to normal folders."
msgstr "請注意：一旦設為共用後，即無法還原為一般資料夾。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:158
msgid "Access"
msgstr "存取"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:162
msgid "This menu is used to restrict access to a document or shared folder:"
msgstr "此選單用於限制文件或共用資料夾的存取："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:164
msgid "From the document: |unlock-alt| **Access**."
msgstr "在文件中：|unlock-alt| **存取**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:165
msgid ""
"From the CryptDrive: ``Right click`` on the document or shared folder > "
"|unlock-alt| **Access**."
msgstr "在 CryptDrive：在文件或共用資料夾上 ``按右鍵`` > |unlock-alt| **存取**。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:170
msgid "Access tab"
msgstr "存取分頁"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:175
msgid "This tab summarises all the modalities of access to the document:"
msgstr "此分頁彙整文件的所有存取方式："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:177
msgid ""
"**Expiration date**: Date at which the document will be deleted. This "
"date is set at the creation of the document and cannot be modified "
"afterwards."
msgstr "**到期日**：文件將被刪除的日期。此日期於建立文件時設定，之後無法修改。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:178
msgid ""
"**Password**: Displays if a password has been set. A new password can be "
"set, or an existing password modified."
msgstr "**密碼**：顯示是否已設定密碼。可設定新密碼或修改既有密碼。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:179
msgid "**Owners**: List of all the document’s `owners <#owners>`__."
msgstr "**擁有者**：文件所有 `擁有者 <#owners>`__ 的清單。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst
msgid "**Edit rights requests**:"
msgstr "**編輯權限請求**："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst
msgid "**Request edit rights**: For users with read-only access rights."
msgstr "**請求編輯權限**：供僅具唯讀存取權限的使用者使用。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst
msgid ""
"|bell-slash| **Mute access requests for this pad**: Hides edit rights "
"requests for this document. :badge_owner:`Document owners`"
msgstr "|bell-slash| **靜音此文件的存取請求**：隱藏此文件的編輯權限請求。:badge_owner:`文件擁有者`"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Access list**: Displays the `access list <#access-list>`__ and "
"indicates if it is enabled."
msgstr "**存取名單**：顯示 `存取名單 <#access-list>`__ 並標示是否已啟用。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:185
msgid "|cptools destroy| **Destroy**: Delete the document permanently."
msgstr "|cptools destroy| **銷毀**：永久刪除文件。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:190
msgid "Access List"
msgstr "存取名單"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:192
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:230
msgid ":badge_owner:`Document owners`"
msgstr ":badge_owner:`文件擁有者`"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:198
msgid ""
"The access list restricts access to a document. Once active, users who "
"are not on the list are not able to access the document, even if they "
"have it stored in their CryptDrive."
msgstr "存取名單可限制文件的存取。啟用後，未在名單上的使用者無法存取該文件，即使該文件已儲存於其 CryptDrive 中。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:200
msgid ""
"To enable the access list, tick **Enable access list**. The `owners "
"<#owners>`__ of the document are on the list by default and cannot be "
"removed from it."
msgstr "若要啟用存取名單，請勾選 **啟用存取名單**。文件的 `擁有者 <#owners>`__ 預設在名單上且無法移除。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:202
msgid "To add contacts or teams to the list:"
msgstr "若要將聯絡人或團隊加入名單："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:204
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:234
msgid "Select them in the list of contacts on the right."
msgstr "在右側聯絡人清單中選取。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:205
#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:235
msgid "Add them to the list with the |arrow-left| button."
msgstr "使用 |arrow-left| 按鈕將其加入名單。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:207
msgid ""
"To remove a user or team from the list use the |times| button next to "
"their name."
msgstr "若要從名單中移除使用者或團隊，請點選其名稱旁的 |times| 按鈕。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:212
msgid "Owners"
msgstr "擁有者"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:217
msgid ""
"This tab is used to manage the ownership of the document. Owners of a "
"document have the following permissions:"
msgstr "此分頁用於管理文件擁有權。文件擁有者具備以下權限："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:219
msgid "Enable an :ref:`access list <access_list>`."
msgstr "啟用 :ref:`存取名單 <access_list>`。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:220
msgid "Enable a password."
msgstr "設定密碼。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:221
msgid "Add or remove other owners."
msgstr "新增或移除其他擁有者。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:222
msgid "Destroy the document."
msgstr "銷毀文件。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:224
msgid "The ownership of a document is set when :ref:`creating it<new_document>`."
msgstr "文件的擁有權於 :ref:`建立時 <new_document>` 設定。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:228
msgid ""
"If a document is created without owners, no one has permissions to manage"
" its ownership. It cannot be permanently destroyed by anyone, but can be "
"removed from the CryptDrive and will be destroyed automatically after 90 "
"days of inactivity."
msgstr ""
"若建立文件時未指定擁有者，則無人具備管理其擁有權的權限。任何人都無法永久銷毀該文件，但可從 CryptDrive 中移除；若 90 "
"天無活動則會自動銷毀。"

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:232
msgid "To add users or teams as owners:"
msgstr "若要將使用者或團隊新增為擁有者："

#: ../../user_guide/share_and_access.rst:237
msgid "To remove an owner, use the |times| button next to their name."
msgstr "若要移除擁有者，請點選其名稱旁的 |times| 按鈕。"

#~ msgid "``Ctrl + e`` > |cptools shared-folder| **Shared folder**."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "``OK`` or press the ``Enter`` key."
#~ msgstr ""

